        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Finally, you can wind up a sentence with a dramatic climax by ignoring some earlier advice. In Lesson 9 we advised you to open a sentence with its point. But self-consciously elegant writers often open a sentence with a series of parallel and coordinate phrases or clauses just so that they can delay and thereby heighten a sense of climax:",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                295,
                772,
                422
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    295.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    422.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    422.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If [journalists] held themselves as responsible for the rise of public cynicism as they hold \"venal\" politicians and the \"selfish\" public; if they considered that the license they have to criticize and defame comes with an implied responsibility to serve the public—if they did all or any of these things, they would make journalism more useful, public life stronger, and themselves far more worthy of esteem.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                436,
                742,
                561
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    436.0
                ],
                [
                    741.0,
                    436.0
                ],
                [
                    741.0,
                    554.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    554.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "—James Fallows, Breaking the News",
            "block_bbox": [
                493,
                574,
                770,
                598
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    493.0,
